ant=\"normal\">y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn></math><br /><math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">D</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">G</mi><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">G</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math><br />4 + 4 – 5 – 2 = 1."
